      "means": "The engine's screen-refresh rules (declared_effects_problem, effects_at, effect_reads, apply_merge), moved whole out of trillion-rust 6cc8609d79 by lane screen-and-uncalled-code-leave-the-run-area (wave w5 of research:reach-anything-outside-plan): what a run changes on a screen is the Workshop's, not one of the engine's five jobs. It was ported from parts/ai-tool-catalog/read-data/declared-effects.ts, which tools/ai-tool-catalog/read-data/declared-effects.ts still holds. The engine no longer checks a row's effects at the catalog or resolves them on a run's answer; a tool's details still carry its `effects` as declared."
